{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a world of mystery, danger, and lightning-fast action in PROTAGONIST COMPLEX one, a pulse-pounding  action game that blends the intensity of razor-sharp melee action with eerie atmosphere. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast-Paced, Empowering Gameplay.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel like a true badass as you slice through enemies with precision and power. Every encounter is a dance of death where you're always just a few hits away from victory or defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenging Yet Rewarding.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a combat system that rewards aggression and caution in equal measure. Push forward to dominate your foes, but manage your resources carefully \u2013 one misstep could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vibrant World.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a visually striking world brought to life with bold, eye-catching  graphics that pops off the screen. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Smashing Evil to a Killer Soundtrack. </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Annihilate your enemies to the beat of a heart-pumping electronic soundtrack inspired by the best of 2000s electronica. Feel the rhythm of combat as you take down hordes of foes.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3067170?t=1772388784","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3067170?t=1772388784","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067170/607443f159a198094ee2d2f766fbb4a0a2b64d45/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772388784","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3067170/607443f159a198094ee2d2f766fbb4a0a2b64d45/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772388784","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-